 "content": "Run `make test-fast` for the unit suite (skips the Postgres and network integration tests). `make test` runs everything but needs `docker compose up db` first. The FX tests also need generated fixtures: run `python scripts/gen_fx_fixtures.py` once, and set `LEDGERLINE_FX_FIXTURES=tests/fixtures/fx` (see docs/testing.md); without it test_currency errors with KeyError at setup."
